,{"children":"\"同步轮询 (Synchronous Polling)\""}]," 彻底转变为**\"异步事件驱动 (Asynchronous Event-Driven)\"**，并将文件描述符（FD）集合的管理权从 \"用户态\" 移交给了 \"内核态\" 以实现状态持久化。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["为了讲清楚，我们把它拆解为三个维度：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"核心痛点"}],"（为什么要有它）、",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"内核架构"}],"（它长什么样）、",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"工作流程"}],"（它是怎么跑的）。"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"1-核心痛点on-的线性复杂度瓶颈","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#1-核心痛点on-的线性复杂度瓶颈","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#1-核心痛点on-的线性复杂度瓶颈"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 核心痛点：O(N) 的线性复杂度瓶颈","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":4,"offset":388},"end":{"line":11,"column":25,"offset":409}}}]},"children":"1. 核心痛点：O(N) 的线性复杂度瓶颈"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["在 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"epoll"}]," 出现之前（Linux 2.6 之前），网络编程主要依赖 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"select"}]," 或 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"poll"}],"。从计算机体系结构角度看，它们存在一个致命的**无状态（Stateless）**设计缺陷。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"select"}],"/",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"poll"}]," 模型要求用户每次发起系统调用时，必须将所有需要监控的 FD 集合传递给内核。内核的处理逻辑如下："]}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"全量拷贝"}],"：将用户态的 FD 数组完整拷贝到内核态。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"全量遍历"}],"：内核必须线性遍历这个 FD 数组，逐个检查对应的硬件设备状态。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"全量返回"}],"：如果发现有就绪事件，或者超时，内核再将修改后的 FD 状态位图拷贝回用户态。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"这种方式有以下弊端："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"上下文切换开销"}],"：在高并发场景下（例如 10 万连接），每次调用都要在用户态和内核态之间传递巨大的数据块。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"CPU 算力浪费"}],"：时间复杂度为 ",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"katex","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"katex-mathml","children":["$","math","math-0",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML","children":["$","semantics","semantics-0",{"children":[["$","mrow","mrow-0",{"children":[["$","mi","mi-0",{"children":"O"}],["$","mo","mo-0",{"stretchy":"false","children":"("}],["$","mi","mi-1",{"children":"N"}],["$","mo","mo-1",{"stretchy":"false","children":")"}]]}],["$","annotation","annotation-0",{"encoding":"application/x-tex","children":"O(N)"}]]}]}]}],["$","span","span-1",{"className":"katex-html","aria-hidden":"true","children":"$L8"}]]}],"。即使 10 万个连接中只有 1 个活跃，内核也必须检查完所有 10 万个状态。随着 ","$L9"," 的增加，系统性能呈线性下降趋势。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23"]}]}],"$L24","$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]]}]}]
